0 Lattice-aliasing fixture (iOS 27 Phase 4). The lattice suite renders each
0 step's addition as a scene on its own, so the steps deliberately overlap.
0 Step 1, a lone 2x2 brick: depth-identical under quarter and half turns.
0 Step 2, a lone 2x4 brick: depth-identical under a half turn.
0 Step 3, an L of a 2x4 and a 2x2: no alternative is depth-identical.
0 Step 4, a 4x4 layer of 2x2 bricks: square, so the turns are identical,
0 and a one-stud shift moves only its outer rows.
0 Name: lattice.ldr
